    "file_name": "AFP_ENG_19970429.0399.tml",
    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970429.0399\n\nTHE HAGUE, April 29 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nCroatian warcrimes suspect to plead not guilty\n\n\n\n\nZlatko Aleksovski, extradited to The Hague to stand trial at the international warcrimes tribunal here, said Tuesday he would plead not guilty to the charges against him.\n\nAleksovski, a former officer in the Bosnian Croat militia (HVO), is charged with involvement in the massacre of dozens of Moslems in the central Bosnian village of Ahmici during Moslem-Croat fighting in 1993.\n\n\"I am innocent of everything\" I have been accused of, he said at a public hearing.\n\nHe said he had read the charge list over night after being transfered to The Hague by Croatia on Monday.",
